  "scope": "Simplify the positive-ordinate case in ArithmeticPellFirstNorm.two_le_ordinate",
  "validation": "Paired current-source target and both direct clients pass with matching client objects; all target declaration/type/axiom and default simp/instance reports match. The paired combined replay pins FirstNorm to FirstIndex and then the adopted PowerRecovery source, with identical downstream objects. Prior source/object records cover direct providers.",
  "limitations": [
    "PellHalfIndex was built against old PellResidueClasses source 5c70f7f7… and object 110e85d1…; other project, Foundation and Mathlib transitive dependencies remain cached and a current-source closure was not rebuilt.",
    "The combined PowerRecovery replay does not rebuild its own downstream clients in the combined environment.",
    "The exploratory target probe lacks contemporaneous before/after input pins; paired builds provide the validation. The original author audit is historical: after source commit its baseline-vs-workspace assertion no longer holds. The post-commit peer audit separately verifies commit and parent snapshots.",
    "Single paired shared-load timing samples are not general performance benchmarks. Namespace and registration comparisons do not establish equality of proof bodies or every persistent environment extension.",
    "Compiled objects are excluded; their receipt hashes and paths are recorded, so independent byte verification requires the external objects."
  ],
